            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# CodexMate 0.0.26

- Adds an optional notch status dot and compact label so the current Codex state is visible before opening the notch menu.
- Adds localized notch status text and a settings toggle for hiding the notch status content.
- Filters empty Codex Desktop placeholder threads from recent and active thread lists while preserving preview-only and session-backed threads with real user content.
]]></description>
